  m_Name: Hard Board Table_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2da076b6776cc384daa3ebf2b151408b, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 148505878528
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Royal Highness Commands Holy Warrior: \u201CDefeat Remaining
      Dark Lords Before State Marriage\u201D\u2026 Warrior Embarks on Journey Today"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238656
    m_Localized: "The King proclaimed to the Holy Warrior today to defeat the three
      remaining Dark Lords before the state marriage could proceed. While subjects
      and officials expressed concern, the King maintained a hardline stance, stating,
      \u201CWe do not know when another Dark Lord might attempt to abduct the Princess.
      We must not forget the maxim: He who strikes first, wins.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238657
    m_Localized: <size=30>[Current Affairs for Dummies] There Is Not Just One Dark
      Lord?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238658
    m_Localized: "In the beginning, the dungeons were divided in four directions
      with the Kingdom at the center. Matching the number of dungeons, there were
      a total of four Dark Lords\u2014Red Dragon, Blue Dragon, White Dragon, and
      Black Dragon. However, peace was maintained in the Kingdom as they either never
      left their dungeons or abandoned their posts and left\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238659
    m_Localized: '<size=30>Holy Warrior Reveals New Content: Conquest, Not Challenge'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238660
    m_Localized: "The Holy Warrior announced new content via his personal Wtube channel.
      He revealed the title <Conquest of the Dark Lord's Castle>, stating it will
      cover the entire journey of defeating the three Dark Lords. <Conquest of the
      Dark Lord's Castle> is scheduled to be released on the Holy Warrior\u2019s
      personal channel starting next week."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238661
    m_Localized: '<size=28>Charge Through Lightning! <Conquest> Ep. 1: Blue Dragon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238662
    m_Localized: "The Holy Warrior reasoned that at least one of the Dark Lords would
      be inside a dungeon and headed to a closed, old dungeon. The Dark Lord waiting
      there was the Blue Dragon, known in legends for controlling lightning. Episode
      1 of <Conquest of the Dark Lord's Castle> is currently available on the Holy
      Warrior\u2019s channel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238663
    m_Localized: "<size=28>\u2018Defamation of Holy Warrior\u2019 Demon A Fined in
      First Trial; \u2018Warrior\u2019s Maids\u2019 Appeal"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238664
    m_Localized: "Demon A was sentenced to a fine of 3,000 Dinars for defamation
      of the Holy Warrior. However, \u2018The Holy Warrior\u2019s Maids\u2019 appealed
      the decision, claiming the sentence was too light. Demon A claimed, \u201CKilling
      the second Dark Lord in such a short time is a fraud in itself,\u201D and argued\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238665
    m_Localized: "<size=28>[Pictorial] \u201CRoyal Highness Was Just an Ordinary
      Doting Father\u201D Royal Private Footage Released"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238666
    m_Localized: "The Royal Family released private footage showing the daily lives
      of the King and the Princess. The King, known as a \u2018Daughter Fool\u2019
      and \u2018Princess Fool,\u2019 was seen with a broad smile the entire time
      he was with the Princess. The Princess also appeared accustomed to this side
      of the King, showing off the close bond between the Royal Family members."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238667
    m_Localized: '<size=28>"Patrasche, So Sleepy..." <Conquest> Ep. 2: White Dragon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238668
    m_Localized: "Based on eyewitness accounts that the Dark Lord White Dragon is
      seen in cold regions, the Holy Warrior headed North. Suddenly, ice spikes soared
      up and attacked the Holy Warrior! Episode 2 of <Conquest of the Dark Lord's
      Castle> is currently available on the Holy Warrior\u2019s channel."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238669
    m_Localized: "<size=28>Royal Highness Unboxes \u2018White Dragon Cloak\u2019
      Loot Presented by Holy Warrior\u2026 \u201CMy Authority Shines\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238670
    m_Localized: "The King released a video today unboxing the White Dragon Cloak
      presented by the Holy Warrior. The King wore the cloak and toured the castle,
      asking \u201CHow is my majesty?\u201D openly revealing his joy."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238671
    m_Localized: "<size=28>\u201CEven a Dragon Is Edible If Fried\u201D Princess
      Reveals Extraordinary Affection for Fried Cuisine"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 148535238672
    m_Localized: "It was revealed at this public banquet that the Princess still
      enjoys fried food. In a past Royal Channel video, the Princess stated, \u201CEven
      a dragon would be tasty if fried; I want to meet a spouse who cooks fried dishes
      in the morning.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
